      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7329608",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Julien",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732960801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732960801": {
            "id": "732960801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How's that? Pretty nice, eh? Pepper also seemed really happy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960802"
            ]
          },
          "732960802": {
            "id": "732960802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Having seen this, I find that words seem superfluous. Caterpillar was right. There is such a wide world outside my metal box...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960803"
            ]
          },
          "732960803": {
            "id": "732960803",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A metal box... You said that you lived in a very small place in Fontaine, didn't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960804"
            ]
          },
          "732960804": {
            "id": "732960804",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ahem. Sumeru sure does have lots of sights to see, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960805"
            ]
          },
          "732960805": {
            "id": "732960805",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, right, that's right! He's already decided to be a proper artist, so let's switch up the scene a bit to... what do they call it... broaden our horizons!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960806"
            ]
          },
          "732960806": {
            "id": "732960806",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He might have said that he wants to give up, but Paimon thinks it's still too early for that! There's still time to reconsider...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960807"
            ]
          },
          "732960807": {
            "id": "732960807",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Just think about it, Julien! There might be sights just as grand as this, or maybe even grander — things you've never seen before! Maybe they'll grant you the inspiration you need!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960808"
            ]
          },
          "732960808": {
            "id": "732960808",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "As for your color recognition, well, you said it yourself! We just \"see something different\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960809"
            ]
          },
          "732960809": {
            "id": "732960809",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But we can all appreciate beauty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960810"
            ]
          },
          "732960810": {
            "id": "732960810",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960811"
            ]
          },
          "732960811": {
            "id": "732960811",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Yes... Your words do make sense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960812"
            ]
          },
          "732960812": {
            "id": "732960812",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Those were your words!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960813"
            ]
          },
          "732960813": {
            "id": "732960813",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I... Haha, so I knew it. I knew it after all, but I just kept walking the wrong path...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960814"
            ]
          },
          "732960814": {
            "id": "732960814",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We only met because Pepper brought you here, right? So we shouldn't just think of it as the \"wrong path\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960815"
            ]
          },
          "732960815": {
            "id": "732960815",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, it's a shame that we couldn't help you find the path of the Oceanids' pilgrimage, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960816"
            ]
          },
          "732960816": {
            "id": "732960816",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Does that even exist...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960817"
            ]
          },
          "732960817": {
            "id": "732960817",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I've always believed it does, but... I think that my ability or lack thereof to find it is unimportant either way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960818"
            ]
          },
          "732960818": {
            "id": "732960818",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "After all, I've already found the answer I desire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960819"
            ]
          },
          "732960819": {
            "id": "732960819",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Thank you, my friends. *sigh* How can I ever show my gratitude?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960820"
            ]
          },
          "732960820": {
            "id": "732960820",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "If only I had bought those mysterious bird eggs... A mystical item like that, one that can help to ward off ill fortune, would certainly be of more use to adventurers like you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960822",
              "732960824"
            ]
          },
          "732960822": {
            "id": "732960822",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Wait, do you really believe in something that convenient, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960825"
            ]
          },
          "732960825": {
            "id": "732960825",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I will continue to stay here for a while. This place really calms the soul. It's quite good for self-reflection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960826"
            ]
          },
          "732960826": {
            "id": "732960826",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I have a feeling that I might be able to draw something a little different this time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960827"
            ]
          },
          "732960827": {
            "id": "732960827",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "Thank you both, dear friends. I wish you smooth sailing in your journey!"
          },
          "732960824": {
            "id": "732960824",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why not? Even if it can't really deflect bad luck, maybe... maybe it might taste a hundred times better than a normal egg!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7329606",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732960601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732960601": {
            "id": "732960601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's make some preparations first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732960602"
            ]
          },
          "732960602": {
            "id": "732960602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright then. Let's go once we're ready!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7329614",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732961401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732961401": {
            "id": "732961401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "One of the good things about leaving the city is not having to specially prepare dog food. Pepper's very capable, in any case, and can procure its own meals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732961402"
            ]
          },
          "732961402": {
            "id": "732961402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "The bad thing, though, is that I lack any talent for combat or cooking. I suppose \"city trash\" is a fitting name for one such as myself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732961403"
            ]
          },
          "732961403": {
            "id": "732961403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732961404"
            ]
          },
          "732961404": {
            "id": "732961404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Julien",
            "text": "I should just focus on recovering."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7329615",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732961501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732961501": {
            "id": "732961501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Pepper",
            "text": "(Looks at you expectantly.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7329699",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732969911"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732969911": {
            "id": "732969911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We previously agreed to guide Julien, and he should've recovered from his injuries by now, right? Why don't we go see him?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732969912"
            ]
          },
          "732969912": {
            "id": "732969912",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If he's learned his lesson, he should be waiting for us at the seaside camp, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732969916"
            ]
          },
          "732969916": {
            "id": "732969916",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Julien cannot keep up. Perhaps you may find him back at the start."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}